Add Shine.com (India) -- server-rendered HTML with JSON-LD, no browser

India had ZERO postings in the corpus. Shine.com is a large Indian job
board with no Cloudflare, no registration wall, and no proxy requirement,
so it sits in the buildable set.

## What was verified

- **Probed 2026-10-20**: server-rendered HTML, real `rel="next"` pagination
  on `/job-search/jobs-in-india`, detail URL `/jobs/<slug>/<company>/<id>`.
- **JSON-LD JobPosting** on every detail page: title, company, numeric id,
  datePosted, validThrough (deadline), employmentType, experience months,
  jobLocation (ISO 'IN'), skills list, industry.
- **No browser** needed -- plain HTTP returns full markup.
- **Dry-run**: 10 fetched, 10 parsed, 10 cleaned, validation PASSED.
- **Live run**: 10 inserted, 0 failed. Geographic resolution works
  (Bangalore/Pune/Hyderabad city_exact; All India/Mumbai City/Noida/
  Chennai fallback_unmatched).

